{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>My Sabbaths you shall keep.</b> It is translated in the Jerusalem Targum in reference to the years of shemittah, for they are called שבת." "<b>And My sanctuary you shall revere.</b> 'The jubilee year shall be holy to you' — thus it is expounded in Tanhuma. The order of the parashah of Behar is complete."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:22.892279204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}